---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms & Conditions | KSTDC Citizen Travel"
  description="Official booking terms, refund schedules, and conduct guidelines for KSTDC state-conducted tours."
>
  <div class="py-10 sm:py-16 bg-canvas min-h-screen">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-8">
      
      <div class="border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 pb-4 space-y-1">
        <span class="text-[11px] font-bold text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 uppercase tracking-wider block">
          Citizen Charter & Legal Information
        </span>
        <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
          Terms & Conditions
        </h1>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">
          Last updated: August 2026 · Karnataka State Tourism Development Corporation
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 shadow-sm space-y-6 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
        
        <section class="space-y-2">
          <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">1. Booking & Ticket Issuance</h2>
          <p>
            All conducted tour packages booked through this platform include round-trip Volvo AC transport, designated Hotel Mayura accommodation on a twin-sharing basis, and the services of state-certified tour guides. A digital boarding pass with a unique booking reference ID is generated upon successful payment.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-2">
          <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">2. Cancellation & Refund Policy</h2>
          <p>
            • <strong>100% Full Refund:</strong> Applicable if cancellation is submitted at least 48 hours prior to scheduled coach departure.<br />
            • <strong>50% Partial Refund:</strong> Applicable if cancellation is submitted between 24 and 48 hours prior to departure.<br />
            • <strong>No Refund:</strong> For cancellations within 24 hours of scheduled departure or in case of a passenger no-show at the pickup point.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-2">
          <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">3. Identity Verification & Reporting</h2>
          <p>
            Every passenger must carry a valid original Government-issued photo identification (Aadhaar Card, Passport, or Voter ID) during coach boarding and hotel check-in. Passengers are requested to report at their designated Bengaluru departure point 15 minutes before departure.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-2">
          <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">4. Senior Citizen Concessions</h2>
          <p>
            Senior citizens aged 60 years and above are eligible for a 5% concession on the base package tariff upon furnishing valid age proof during check-in. Ground-floor room allocation at Hotel Mayura is provided subject to availability.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-2">
          <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">5. Prototype Disclaimer</h2>
          <p class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 text-xs">
            This digital platform is a prototype redesign concept created for the <em>Build What Moves India</em> hackathon. It uses synthetic and mock booking data for review purposes and is not directly integrated with live production banking or transport systems.
          </p>
        </section>

      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
